  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 350°F (180°C).",
    "In a large bowl, mix together coconut flakes, butter, sugar free granulated sweetener, and coconut oil.",
    "Press the mixture into a 8-inch baking dish.",
    "In a separate bowl, mix together almond flour and crumble topping.",
